# Claude Code
# Local and machine-specific by default (settings.local.json, launch.json).
# Skills are the exception: they are shared workflow rather than local config,
# and are no use if every session has to be handed them out of band.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/handoff.md
